{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログを開いてくださり、ありがとうございます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46 三期生 山口県出身🐡 21歳の\n谷口愛季(たにぐちあいり)です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ーーー 音楽の日 ーーー"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "音楽の日ありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mob3OyBBd.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobiIImRn.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "珍しくツインテールしてみたよ〜！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobsSHfeV.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobAQ4BA8.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "かわいい〜〜？？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobWFUZe1.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "久しぶりにカラコンなんかつけちゃったりして"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お気に入りの衣装また着れて嬉しかったな〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ライブの時は写真撮れなかったから、\nこの日にたーーくさん撮ったよ！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobKQVvPt.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mob9tt6u7.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobrK3yjs.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "はるよさん〜！\nお互いフッ軽すぎて遊ぶ予定すぐ決まっちゃいますねっ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2人で行った箱根旅の様子が櫻坂チャンネルにて公開されているので、ぜひチェックしてくださいね！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/o0FFV0qKiN8?si=_1wPSjyx78eGg8q0"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして、\nDREAMダンス企画に坂道選抜メンバーとして参加させていただきました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "このような機会をいただけて本当に嬉しかったです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回のダンスは素早く細かい動きが多く、\n限られた時間で動きを合わせるのはなかなか難しかったのですが、一人一人の練習量がすごくて、、！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私もしっかり喰らい付いていかなければと刺激をいただきました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして、\nダンス企画に参加されている皆さんのパフォーマンスが見ているだけで笑顔になってしまうくらい、本当に素敵でかっこよかったです。\nダンスの力ってすごい！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もっともっと成長して、\nさらにかっこいいと思って貰えるような\nパフォーマンスがしたいです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "楽しかったな〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobCI3B2n.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobaZKCQB.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "岩本さん"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobE5zIlq.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みくちゃん"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mob4OOb93.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みつきちゃん"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobqNE7fy.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobcu0GjO.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "囲んでもらっちゃった〜！\nはっぴーーー♪"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/S__35225677.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "金村さん"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobU7IC1y.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こにちゃん"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobFs82pI.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobPCzkwI.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "りなちゃん"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobGT5cCJ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "Instagramにも載せたのですが、\n嬉しすぎたのでこっちにもーー！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一緒にこの企画に参加することができて本当に嬉しかったです！\n努力家なみなさんを本当に尊敬しています。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また一緒にお仕事できるように頑張ります！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobGdsu8G.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "楽しかったね〜！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一緒に練習できて、パフォーマンスできて本当に嬉しかったよ〜\nどうやったらかっこよく見えるかなとか、\nこっちの角度の方が綺麗？とか、お互いに研究し合った時間がとーっても幸せでした！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "普段からよく話し合ってるからこそ\n練習もスムーズにできたと思うし、\n自分たちがどうみせたいか、言葉にしなくても互いに分かってる感覚があって嬉しかったな〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ツアーも頑張ろうね〜！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーー"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日から\nSakurazaka46 ARENA TOUR 2026\n-What's lonesome?-がスタートします！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "かなり日差しが強く、気温も高いので\n熱中症には気をつけて下さいね〜！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "涼しいところでなるべく過ごして、\nたくさん水分、塩分を摂ってください！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "約束です！"}], "source": "official"}